  <header class="privacy-hero">
    <div class="privacy-hero-badge">🔒 Privacy First</div>
    <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
    <p>We believe privacy is a right, not a feature. Here is exactly what data we collect, why we collect it, and how you can control it — in plain language.</p>
    <div class="privacy-meta">
      <span>📅 Last updated: October 2026</span>
      <span>⏱️ ~5 min read</span>
      <span>🏠 Applies to: footmarq.app</span>
    </div>
  </header>

  <div class="privacy-layout">
